  "description": "Omega Harim attacks a random stranger for money in the midst of his heat cycle. But the man he tries to attack is an Alpha and leader of a large organization. Believing that Harim was sent to kill him, the Alpha throws some heat cycle sedatives at him and warns him to not cause any more trouble. But then Harim foolishly steals the man's wallet and gets caught, after which he is forced to become the Alpha's maid… \n\n(Source: Webnovel)",
